---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Software support — Vertabyte" description="Contact Vertabyte Tech Limited for help with its software products, technical questions and product enquiries at info@vertabyte.tech.">
  <div class="document-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">VERTABYTE TECH LIMITED</p><h1>How can we help?</h1><p>Contact us for help with Vertabyte software, technical questions or information about a product in development.</p></div></div>
  <article class="container document">
    <div class="email-panel"><a href="mailto:info@vertabyte.tech?subject=Vertabyte%20software%20support">info@vertabyte.tech <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p>Send your support enquiry to Vertabyte Tech Limited. Include the product name or a brief description in the subject line so we can understand your request.</p></div>
    <h2>Tell us what happened</h2><p>To help us investigate, please include:</p><ul><li>The software product and the task you were trying to complete.</li><li>A description of the issue, including any error message.</li><li>The steps that led to the problem and whether it happens again.</li><li>Your device, operating system and browser or app version, if relevant.</li></ul><p>A screenshot can be helpful. Remove personal, student, financial or other confidential information before sending it.</p>
    <h2>Keep your information safe</h2><p>Never send passwords, authentication codes, payment card details or complete customer or student records. If your issue involves sensitive information, describe the problem without including that information.</p>
    <h2>Product and availability enquiries</h2><p>Our school management software is in development. You can email us with questions about its intended scope or availability. This page does not provide a public registration or download service.</p>
    <h2>Privacy questions</h2><p>For questions about information shared with us, use the same email address with “Privacy enquiry” in the subject. Our <a href="/privacy">website privacy notice</a> explains how we handle corporate website enquiries.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
